---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="About Us | Pool Services Spring TX" description="Local pool service company serving Spring, TX and surrounding areas. Licensed, insured, and focused on clear water and reliable care.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Pool Services Spring TX</h1>
      <p>Local technicians dedicated to keeping Spring pools clean, safe, and ready for family time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>We are a local pool service company based near 18913 Tomato St in Spring, TX. Our focus is simple: consistent weekly care, honest repairs, and water chemistry that keeps your pool enjoyable all season.</p>
      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Route-based weekly service so you know when we will be there</li>
        <li>Trained, insured technicians familiar with local water conditions</li>
        <li>Upfront pricing and no-pressure recommendations</li>
        <li>Clear communication after every visit</li>
        <li>Priority response when something goes wrong</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Serving Spring &amp; Beyond</h2>
      <p>We proudly serve Spring (77379 and nearby zips), Klein, Champions, Tomball, and surrounding Harris County communities. Whether you need weekly maintenance or help recovering a green pool, we are ready to help.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
